 "voice": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "t": 0.2,
   "dur": 3.124,
   "file": "vo/01.wav",
   "text": "Now a year has more than a thousand days in it."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "t": 3.8,
   "dur": 1.972,
   "file": "vo/02.wav",
   "text": "Meanwhile, the calendar breaks."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "t": 6.2,
   "dur": 4.446,
   "file": "vo/03.wav",
   "text": "But every day gets shorter, so a year contains more days."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "t": 11.0,
   "dur": 7.214,
   "file": "vo/04.wav",
   "text": "Right now, at a six hour day, a year already holds about fourteen hundred and sixty days."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "t": 18.666666666666668,
   "dur": 9.632,
   "file": "vo/05.wav",
   "text": "By the end, it would hold over six thousand, with a sunrise every eighty-four minutes, and you would be asked to sleep eight times a day."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "t": 28.7,
   "dur": 3.341,
   "file": "vo/06.wav",
   "text": "At the poles, the ground only turns on the spot."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "t": 32.43333333333333,
   "dur": 5.218,
   "file": "vo/07.wav",
   "text": "Nobody there is carried around at all, and they would weigh the same as ever."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "t": 38.0,
   "dur": 9.356,
   "file": "vo/08.wav",
   "text": "At forty-five degrees north, you move at seventy percent of the equator's speed, and the push outward is only half as strong."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "t": 47.733333333333334,
   "dur": 4.756,
   "file": "vo/09.wav",
   "text": "The farther you stand from the equator, the longer you keep your weight."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "t": 52.93333333333333,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "file": "vo/10.wav",
   "text": "Quick break: like and follow. Then let's see how bad this gets."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo11",
   "t": 57.8,
   "dur": 6.695,
   "file": "vo/11.wav",
   "text": "But the water leaves the poles first, so the stillest place on Earth would stand high and dry."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo12",
   "t": 64.83333333333333,
   "dur": 2.017,
   "file": "vo/12.wav",
   "text": "And the days keep getting shorter."
  },
  {
   "id": "vo13",
   "t": 67.2,
   "dur": 3.378,
   "file": "vo/13.wav",
   "text": "Part six of eight. Full video on YouTube."
  }
 ]
}